---
import { ArrowDown, ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';

const sessions = [
  'Session 01 · decision made',
  'Session 02 · new working context',
  'Session 03 · later task continues',
];

const artifacts = [
  'constitution · spec',
  'plan · tasks',
  'decision records',
  'implementation · tests',
];
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  className="is-open"
  figureNumber="01"
  eyebrow="Editorial model · repository pattern"
  title="A session ends; the repository remains"
  caption="This is a continuity model, not a claim that every agent reads these files or that a repository rule guarantees correct behavior."
>
  <div class="continuity-map">
    <section class="working-context">
      <span class="label">Working context</span>
      <div class="session-list">
        {sessions.map((session, index) => (
          <div class:list={['session', index === 0 && 'is-current']}>
            <span>{session}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p>Goals, corrections, and trade-offs are useful while they are visible.</p>
      <span class="boundary-note">Conversation context is not assumed to carry forward.</span>
    </section>

    <div class="transition" aria-hidden="true">
      <ArrowDown class="arrow-down" size={17} stroke-width={1.75} />
      <ArrowRight class="arrow-right" size={17} stroke-width={1.75} />
    </div>

    <section class="durable-memory">
      <span class="label accent">Durable project memory</span>
      <strong>An address for the next task</strong>
      <div class="artifact-grid">
        {artifacts.map((artifact) => <code>{artifact}</code>)}
      </div>
      <p>Different artifacts preserve different kinds of intent and evidence.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  .continuity-map {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  section {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .label,
  .session span,
  .boundary-note,
  code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
  }

  .label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .label.accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .session-list {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    border-left: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
  }

  .session {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 0.7rem 0 0.7rem 0.9rem;
  }

  .session:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .session span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .session.is-current span {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  section p {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .boundary-note {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .transition {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .transition :global(.arrow-right) {
    display: none;
  }

  .durable-memory {
    position: relative;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .durable-memory > strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .artifact-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  code {
    border: 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-secondary) !important;
    font-size: 0.75rem !important;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .continuity-map {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 3rem minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      align-items: center;
    }

    .transition :global(.arrow-down) {
      display: none;
    }

    .transition :global(.arrow-right) {
      display: block;
    }

    .artifact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
